            "paragraph": "We performed a spatial analysis to evaluate the possibility of integrating urban agrivoltaics into vacant spaces in cities, including vacant lands and rooftops, which have been assessed as highly suitable for PV installations in places with limited space 71. Accordingly, we chose Philadelphia, USA, due to its location in a temperate climate zone, its representation of typical cities facing common urban challenges (e.g., urban heat islands, food and energy inaccessibility), and its social and cultural heterogeneity.",
