            "target_entity_instance": "Temperate",
            "target_entity_type": "ClimateZone",
            "paragraph": "Despite growing interest, to our knowledge, no study has comprehensively evaluated the performance of agrivoltaic systems specifically designed for urban environments in temperate climates. Here, we compare the food production of such a system to that of a control garden in the U.S. Mid-Altantic region and examine any associated physiological, morphological, and nutritional differences in the crops.",
